  "name": "Chickpea & Coconut Dhal",
  "subtitle": "Creamy spiced legumes with a crisp shallot tempering",
  "description": "A hearty Indian-style dhal combining chickpeas, yellow split peas, coconut milk, and aromatic spices, finished with fried shallots and fresh coriander.",
